{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.animal.statblock.predator-a","title":"Хищник A","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Животные","path":"Monsters/monster/animal/statblock/predator-a.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.animal.statblock/predator-a","originalName":"Predator A","originalDescription":"|      Animal       |         -         |      Level 1      |      Elite Brute      |        EV 12         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|   **2**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **80**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **5**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+1**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility | **-2**<br>Reason  |  **+1**<br>Intuition  |  **+1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🗡 **Natural Weapon (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                 **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|--------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**            | **🎯 Two creatures or objects** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 7 damage\n> - **12-16:** 10 damage; M < 1 [prone](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/prone)\n> - **17+:** 13 damage; M < 1 [prone](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/prone)\n\n> 👤 **Ready to Strike**\n>\n> | **-**       | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 Self** |  **🎯 Self** |\n>\n> **Effect:** The predator assesses their environment or lets loose a threatening roar and gains an edge on their next strike.\n\n> ❗️ **Quick Strike**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                     **[Triggered action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/triggered-action)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**            | **🎯 The triggering creature or object** |  \n>\n> **Trigger:** A creature or object comes within distance.\n>\n> **Effect:** The predator makes a [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) against the target. If the predator was hidden from the target, the strike deals an extra 3 damage.\n\n> ⭐️ **Nature's Spirit**\n>\n> While outdoors or in a natural environment, the predator can negate a bane on their abilities or turn a double bane into a bane.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/animal/statblock/predator-a.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"animal","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"12","size":"2","keywords":["Животное"],"role":"Громила","organization":"Элита"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.animal.statblock.predator-a"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.group.animal","title":"Животные"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.animal.statblock.predator-a","kind":"monster","name":"Хищник A","markdown":"| Животное | — | Уровень 1 | Элита, Громила | Боевая ценность 12 |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n| **2**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **80**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **5**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **—**<br>Иммунитет | **—**<br>Движение | — | **—**<br>С капитаном | **—**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **+1**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **-2**<br>Разум | **+1**<br>Интуиция | **+1**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🗡 **Естественное оружие (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Ближний бой, Удар, Оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|--------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ближний бой 1** | **🎯 Два существа или объекта** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 7 урона\n> - **12-16:** 10 урона; М < 1 — [сбито с ног](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.prone)\n> - **17+:** 13 урона; М < 1 — [сбито с ног](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.prone)\n\n> 👤 **Приготовиться к удару**\n>\n> | **—** | **[Маневр](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 На себя** | **🎯 На себя** |\n>\n> **Эффект:** Хищник оценивает обстановку или издаёт угрожающий рык и получает преимущество на следующую атаку.\n\n> ❗️ **Быстрый удар**\n>\n> | **Ближний бой, Удар, Оружие** | **[Триггер](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.triggered-action)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ближний бой 1** | **🎯 Существо или объект, вызвавшие срабатывание** |\n>\n> **Условие:** Существо или объект приближается в пределах дистанции.\n>\n> **Эффект:** Хищник делает по цели [свободный удар](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.free-strike). Если хищник был скрыт от цели, удар наносит дополнительно 3 урона.\n\n> ⭐️ **Дух природы**\n>\n> На открытом воздухе или в естественной среде хищник может отменить помеху на броски своих способностей или заменить двойную помеху помехой.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.animal.statblock.predator-a","path":"Monsters/monster/animal/statblock/predator-a.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.animal.statblock/predator-a","originalName":"Predator A","originalDescription":"|      Animal       |         -         |      Level 1      |      Elite Brute      |        EV 12         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|   **2**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **80**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **5**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+1**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility | **-2**<br>Reason  |  **+1**<br>Intuition  |  **+1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🗡 **Natural Weapon (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                 **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |---------------------------|--------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**            | **🎯 Two creatures or objects** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 7 damage\n> - **12-16:** 10 damage; M < 1 [prone](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/prone)\n> - **17+:** 13 damage; M < 1 [prone](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/condition/prone)\n\n> 👤 **Ready to Strike**\n>\n> | **-**       | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 Self** |  **🎯 Self** |\n>\n> **Effect:** The predator assesses their environment or lets loose a threatening roar and gains an edge on their next strike.\n\n> ❗️ **Quick Strike**\n>\n> | **Melee, Strike, Weapon** |                     **[Triggered action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/triggered-action)** |\n> |---------------------------|-----------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**            | **🎯 The triggering creature or object** |  \n>\n> **Trigger:** A creature or object comes within distance.\n>\n> **Effect:** The predator makes a [free strike](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/feature.common.main-actions/free-strike) against the target. If the predator was hidden from the target, the strike deals an extra 3 damage.\n\n> ⭐️ **Nature's Spirit**\n>\n> While outdoors or in a natural environment, the predator can negate a bane on their abilities or turn a double bane into a bane.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/animal/statblock/predator-a.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"animal","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"12","size":"2","keywords":["Животное"],"role":"Громила","organization":"Элита"},"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"},"printedCreature":{"ru":[0,[[6,[[2,["Животное"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"keywords"}}}],[2,["Уровень 1"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"level"}}}],[2,["Элита, Громила"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"organization"}}}],[2,["Боевая ценность 12"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"ev"}}}],[6,[[2,[[3,["2"]